ion (W.V.B.A.) champion."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/be/Punch-Out%21%21_series_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punch-Out!!"},{"title":"Glove","blocks":[{"text":"A glove is a garment covering the hand, with separate sheaths or openings for each finger including the thumb. Gloves protect and comfort hands against cold or heat, damage by friction, abrasion or chemicals, and disease; or in turn to provide a guard for what a bare hand should not touch."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Centre_de_Documentaci%C3%B3_Museu_T%C3%A8xtil_de_Terrassa-_Reserves-_Teixits-_Guants002.JPG/330px-Centre_de_Documentaci%C3%B3_Museu_T%C3%A8xtil_de_Terrassa-_Reserves-_Teixits-_Guants002.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glove"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/JJS_Karate_Kids_on_Training.jpg/500px-JJS_Karate_Kids_on_Training.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/JJS_Karate_Kids_on_Training.jpg/1280px-JJS_Karate_Kids_on_Training.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/JJS_Karate_Kids_on_Training.jpg/500px-JJS_Karate_Kids_on_Training.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A karateka performing a 'reverse punch' or gyaku zuki being performed by two young boys.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJJS_Karate_Kids_on_Training.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Seiken.png/120px-Seiken.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Seiken.png/250px-Seike